# BAB 6. Operational Domain Schema

## 6.1 Overview

Bab ini mendesain skema domain **Operasional**: Procurement, Inventory, Sales, dan Manufacturing. Domain ini mengutamakan ketersediaan & *throughput* (SAD BAB 4.6) dan terhubung ke domain finansial melalui event (INT-001/002). **Inventory Reservation** menerapkan Exactly-Once (ADR-005). Tabel pergerakan bervolume tinggi dipartisi RANGE per tanggal (DBS-013). Seluruh tabel mengikuti standar BAB 2.

---

## 6.2 Procurement (`procurement_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.7: permintaan → PO → penerimaan; menerbitkan `procurement.po.approved` & `procurement.goods.received` (INT-002).

```mermaid
erDiagram
  PURCHASE_REQUISITION ||--|{ PR_LINE : contains
  PURCHASE_ORDER ||--|{ PO_LINE : contains
  PURCHASE_REQUISITION ||--o{ PURCHASE_ORDER : sourced_into
  PURCHASE_ORDER ||--o{ GOODS_RECEIPT : received_by
  GOODS_RECEIPT ||--|{ GR_LINE : contains
```

### `pr.purchase_requisition`

| Column          | Type          | Null | Key | Description                                            |
| --------------- | ------------- | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `pr_no`         | VARCHAR(50)   | No   | U   | Nomor PR.                                              |
| `requester_id`  | UUID          | No   | IDX | Pemohon (ref logis user).                             |
