| --------------- | ------------- | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `po_no`         | VARCHAR(50)   | No   | U   | Nomor PO.                                              |
| `vendor_id`     | UUID          | No   | IDX | Vendor (ref logis `masterdata_db`).                   |
| `order_date`    | DATE          | No   |     | Tanggal PO.                                            |
| `currency_code` | VARCHAR(3)    | No   |     | Mata uang.                                             |
| `total_amount`  | NUMERIC(20,4) | No   |     | Total nilai PO.                                        |
| `status`        | VARCHAR(20)   | No   | IDX | Draft/Approved/PartiallyReceived/Received/Closed.     |

### `po.po_line`

| Column        | Type          | Null | Key | Description                                    |
| ------------- | ------------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `purchase_order_id`| UUID     | No   | FK  | Induk PO.                                      |
| `item_id`     | UUID          | No   | IDX | Item (ref logis `masterdata_db`).             |
