## 6.3 Inventory (`inventory_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.8: stok, gudang, pergerakan; reservasi (Exactly-Once); menerbitkan `inventory.stock.reserved`, `inventory.goods.issued/received` (INT-001/002).

```mermaid
erDiagram
  WAREHOUSE ||--o{ STOCK_BALANCE : holds
  ITEM_REF ||--o{ STOCK_BALANCE : quantified_in
  STOCK_BALANCE ||--o{ STOCK_MOVEMENT : changed_by
  STOCK_RESERVATION }o--|| ITEM_REF : reserves
```

### `inv.warehouse`

| Column   | Type         | Null | Key | Description                          |
| -------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------ |
| `code`   | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U   | Kode gudang.                         |
| `name`   | VARCHAR(150) | No   |     | Nama gudang.                         |
| `organization_ref_id`| UUID | No | IDX | Unit organisasi pemilik.            |

### `inv.stock_balance` (saldo stok per item/gudang)

| Column          | Type          | Null | Key | Description                                    |
| --------------- | ------------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `warehouse_id`  | UUID          | No   | IDX | Gudang.                                        |
| `item_id`       | UUID          | No   | IDX | Item (ref logis).                              |
| `on_hand_qty`   | NUMERIC(20,4) | No   |     | Kuantitas fisik.                               |
| `reserved_qty`  | NUMERIC(20,4) | No   |     | Kuantitas dicadangkan.                         |
| `available_qty` | NUMERIC(20,4) | No   |     | Tersedia (on_hand − reserved).                 |
| `avg_cost`      | NUMERIC(20,4) | No   |     | Biaya rata-rata (costing).                     |

**Unique:** `uq_stock_balance (organization_id, warehouse_id, item_id)`. Update saldo menggunakan optimistic locking / row lock untuk konsistensi reservasi (EOS).

